+- SCOPE: `references/core/relux-core.md`, `references/swiftui/swiftui-relux.md`, `references/modules/module-conventions.md`, `instructions/ui-integration.md`, `snippets/temporal-state.md`, `snippets/store-cleanup.md`, `TASK-260730-3ev75n`.
