# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented in this file.

## [Unreleased]

### Changed

- Established top-level `action`/`actions` as the canonical application
  dispatch API, narrowed direct dispatcher calls to explicit injected or
  exact-runtime boundaries, and aligned SwiftUI, temporal-state, and logout
  examples with that rule.
